# Vite copies frontend/index.html verbatim. On Windows the checkout is CRLF,
# so the built shell would land in the repository as CRLF while CI builds it as
# LF; git then treats the file as binary and every build shows a binary diff.
# Pin this one file to LF; the PNG/MP3 assets next to it stay binary.
kamra/public/frontend/index.html text eol=lf
